  "hero": "<section class=\"sout-hero\"><span class=\"sout-kicker\">STRUCTURED OUTPUT · VISUAL STUDY</span><h2>Turn model responses into data your application can validate.</h2><p>Define JSON contracts, understand strict schemas, preserve missing facts, verify sources, handle refusals and evolve contracts safely.</p><div class=\"sout-art\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" viewBox=\"0 0 1000 430\" role=\"img\" aria-labelledby=\"so-rev0t so-rev0d\"><title id=\"so-rev0t\">From an invoice sentence to typed JSON fields</title><desc id=\"so-rev0d\">The source order A-240 and total 18.50 are mapped into a JSON object tree with order_id string, total number, and a nullable missing due_date.</desc><rect x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1000\" height=\"430\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#f8fcfd\"/><text x=\"38\" y=\"40\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" font-size=\"14\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#299980\">STRUCTURED OUTPUT · VISUAL REBUILD</text><text x=\"38\" y=\"79\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" font-size=\"24\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#2c5268\">From an invoice sentence to typed JSON fields</text><text x=\"53\" y=\"118\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"850\" font-size=\"16\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#668290\">INVOICE TEXT IS TRANSFORMED INTO TYPED VALUES</text><text x=\"55\" y=\"173\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#2c5268\">Order A-240</text><text x=\"55\" y=\"218\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"780\" font-size=\"22\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#2c5268\">Total $18.50</text><text x=\"56\" y=\"256\" font-family=\"system-ui,Segoe UI,Arial,sans-serif\" font-weight=\"690\" font-size=\"17\" text-anchor=\"start\" fill=\"#668290\">No due date shown</text><line x1=\"305\" y1=\"219\" x2=\"360\" y2=\"219\" stroke=\"#448eaf\" stroke-width=\"3\" /><p